---
description: Project protocol for all work in this repo
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root for every change. It is the canonical protocol.

Key points:
- Never commit anything from `data/` (except `data/README.md`), `.xlsx`, `.env` or keys.
- `system/` is Python standard library only, deterministic, no network, no LLM.
- When in doubt the engine answers REVIEW; never make a change that can clear a hit on missing data.
- Work only on an issue you claimed: `python tools/task.py claim N --agent cursor`; finish with `python tools/task.py done`.
- `python system/screen.py eval --data data/dev` must report 0 unsafe clearances before you finish.
